<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy // Trade Opportunities</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style is:inline>
      :root {
        --bg-page: #f8fafc;
        --bg-surface: #ffffff;
        --border-subtle: #e2e8f0;
        --text-primary: #0f172a;
        --text-secondary: #475569;
        --brand-accent: #2563eb;
      }
      html[data-theme="dark"] {
        --bg-page: #0b0e14;
        --bg-surface: #111622;
        --border-subtle: #1e2638;
        --text-primary: #f1f5f9;
        --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
        --brand-accent: #3b82f6;
      }
      body {
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--bg-page);
        color: var(--text-primary);
        line-height: 1.6;
        padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
      }
      .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      p { font-size: 0.925rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
      a { color: var(--brand-accent); text-decoration: none; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      .back-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <a href="../" class="back-link">&larr; Return to Terminal</a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: August 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>Trade Opportunities operates as a privacy-first platform. We do not require account registration, usernames, or passwords. We may process anonymized technical data including IP addresses, browser types, and interaction telemetry to monitor system stability.</p>

      <h2>2. Cookies & Local Storage</h2>
      <p>We use local storage strictly to remember your interface preferences (such as light/dark theme) and cookie acknowledgment state. Third-party advertising partners (such as A-ADS) may deploy cookies to deliver contextual promotions.</p>

      <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>Our website interfaces with external partners including TradingView, ChangeNOW, and SimpleSwap. When navigating to these external desks, your interactions are governed by their respective privacy terms.</p>

      <h2>4. Contact & Inquiries</h2>
      <p>For inquiries regarding our algorithmic dispatches or data practices, please consult our public repository documentation.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
